#3910
nomad Darrel Zel'hir ranger man~
the nomad, Darrel Zel'hir~
A tall man, dressed in desert garb, looks you over as you approach.
~
This man is formidable indeed...all you can see is his eyes peeking out of a
desert cowl.  Dressed and robed in the style of the Talon nomads, he has
various pouches and bags hanging from his waist, right next to the large
scimitar.  Upon sighting the large blade, you notice the strange green gem in
the hilt, and all those tavern tales come rushing back to you....this is
Darrel Zel'hir, Master Nomad of the East, and is not to be trifled with.
~
17826817 -1839169408&256 1000 C
65 0 0 8d1+0 0d0+0
0 0
112 112 1
13 13 13 13 13 13 13
0 0 0 0 0
0 6 0 0 1835007 1 0
0 0 2047 3145728 0 0 16778224 524295
> death_prog 20~
say Now I wander to the great desert in the sky!
rinvoke artifact
~
> hitprcnt_prog 5~
snarl
if rand(7)
  say No, I refuse to fall!
  else
  if rand(13)
     say I shall not let you slay me!
     else
     if rand(14)
        say You think you are mighty?
        else
        if rand(17)
           say I shall overcome my wounds!
           else
           if rand(20)
              say You cannot defeat me!
              else
              if rand(25)
                 say Death is not an option!
                 else
                 if rand(33)
                    say Must...ignore...the...blood!
                    else
                    if rand(50)
                       say Gods, I am wounded!
                    endif
                 endif
              endif
           endif
        endif
     endif
   endif
endif~
